# Figure visual audit

- Text extract (`docs/PDF_TEXT_EXTRACT.md`) does **not** show TikZ overlaps. For collision checks, run `python scripts/figure_visual_audit.py` after `pip install pymupdf`, then inspect `audit/figure_visual/exports/page-*.png` and follow `prompts/figure_visual_audit_loop.md`.
- Figure label → page mapping comes from `paper/main.aux`; TikZ paths optional in `audit/figure_visual/manifest.json`.
- Full workflow: `docs/FIGURE_VISUAL_AUDIT.md`.
